sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Mhs as 👤 Mahasiswa
    participant Portal as 🌐 Portal SIAKAD (KRS)
    participant KRSService as ⚙️ Enrollment Service
    participant Payment as 💳 Payment Entity
    participant Course as 📚 Course Entity
    participant Enrollment as 📝 Enrollment Entity
    actor DosenWali as 👨‍🏫 Dosen Wali
    participant Observer as 🔔 IEnrollmentObserver

    Note over Mhs,Portal: Tahap 1: Validasi Prasyarat Pembayaran SPP (Financial Prerequisite)
    Mhs->>Portal: Buka menu Pengisian KRS (semester aktif)
    Portal->>KRSService: cekKelayakanPengisianKRS(nim, semesterAktif)
    KRSService->>Payment: getPayment(nim, semesterAktif)
    Payment-->>KRSService: paymentObj
    KRSService->>Payment: isLunas()

    alt Status Pembayaran Belum Lunas
        Payment-->>KRSService: false (Status: "PENDING" / "BELUM_BAYAR")
        KRSService-->>Portal: Error("KRS Terkunci: Tagihan SPP semester berjalan belum lunas")
        Portal-->>Mhs: Tampilkan peringatan & instruksi pembayaran SPP
    else Status Pembayaran Lunas
        Payment-->>KRSService: true (Status: "LUNAS")
        KRSService->>Course: getKatalogPenawaran(semesterAktif)
        Course-->>KRSService: listCourseTersedia
        KRSService-->>Portal: Akses KRS dibuka & tampilkan katalog mata kuliah
        Portal-->>Mhs: Tampilkan daftar mata kuliah yang dapat dipilih

        Note over Mhs,Course: Tahap 2: Pemilihan Mata Kuliah & Pengecekan Prasyarat Akademik
        Mhs->>Portal: Pilih daftar mata kuliah & submit isiKRS(courses)
        Portal->>KRSService: prosesPengajuanKRS(nim, listSelectedCourses)

        loop Untuk Setiap Course yang Dipilih
            KRSService->>Course: validasiPrasyarat(mahasiswa)
            alt Prasyarat Akademik Tidak Terpenuhi
                Course-->>KRSService: false (Mata kuliah prasyarat belum lulus)
                KRSService-->>Portal: Warning("Mata kuliah [kode] ditolak: prasyarat belum terpenuhi")
            else Prasyarat Akademik Terpenuhi
                Course-->>KRSService: true (Lulus prasyarat)
                KRSService->>Enrollment: createEnrollment(mahasiswa, course, status="PENDING_APPROVAL")
                Enrollment->>Enrollment: attachObserver(mahasiswa)
                Enrollment-->>KRSService: enrollmentRecord
            end
        end

        KRSService-->>Portal: Draft KRS berhasil diajukan, menunggu persetujuan
        Portal-->>Mhs: Tampilkan ringkasan KRS berstatus "PENDING_APPROVAL"

        Note over DosenWali,Observer: Tahap 3: Validasi & Persetujuan Dosen Wali (DPA)
        KRSService->>DosenWali: Notifikasi pengajuan KRS mahasiswa bimbingan
        DosenWali->>Portal: Buka menu validasi KRS mahasiswa bimbingan
        Portal->>KRSService: getDetailKRS(nim, semesterAktif)
        KRSService-->>Portal: listEnrollment
        Portal-->>DosenWali: Tampilkan rencana mata kuliah & jadwal

        alt Dosen Wali Menyetujui KRS
            DosenWali->>Portal: Setujui KRS (Approve All)
            Portal->>KRSService: approveKRS(nim, semesterAktif)
            KRSService->>Enrollment: setStatus("APPROVED")
            Enrollment->>Observer: onEnrollmentStatusChanged(enrollment, "APPROVED")
            Observer-->>Mhs: Notifikasi real-time: "KRS Disetujui Dosen Wali"
            KRSService-->>Portal: Konfirmasi KRS aktif
            Portal-->>DosenWali: KRS berhasil disetujui
        else Dosen Wali Menolak / Minta Revisi KRS
            DosenWali->>Portal: Tolak KRS (inputCatatanRevisi)
            Portal->>KRSService: rejectKRS(nim, catatan)
            KRSService->>Enrollment: setStatus("REVISED / REJECTED")
            Enrollment->>Observer: onEnrollmentStatusChanged(enrollment, "REJECTED")
            Observer-->>Mhs: Notifikasi: "KRS Ditolak, silakan lakukan revisi"
            KRSService-->>Portal: Konfirmasi penolakan tersimpan
            Portal-->>DosenWali: Status penolakan & catatan terkirim
        end
    end
